1
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,799
13.

2
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,839
21.

3
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,199
34.

4
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,559
55.

5
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,679
89.

6
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:37,599
89… 144.

7
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,280
233.

8
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,480
233.

9
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,599
233

10
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:46,999
- Yoo-shin, Dad's boss is calling.
- Faye-bo's dad.

11
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,639
Faye-bo's dad…

12
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,879
Got it.

13
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,919
What number comes before 233?

14
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:56,520
144, 233.

15
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,760
377.

16
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,040
610.

17
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,039
987.

18
00:03:04,040 --> 00:03:06,119
1,597.

19
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,919
2,574.

20
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:08,920
That's wrong.

21
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,240
2,584.

22
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,720
It's so cold here.

23
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:22,040
The air is terrible too.

24
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:25,800
I don't know why, but everything changed

25
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,679
when I walked out.

26
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:30,000
Everything changed.

27
00:03:31,600 --> 00:03:32,880
But the roads here

28
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:35,360
look just like ours.

29
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:42,400
I'M FINE. DON'T WORRY.
REST UP, SCHOOL TOMORROW.

30
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,760
MOM

31
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:07,720
<i>Your call has been forwarded to…</i>

32
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:13,920
<i>Your call has been forwarded to voicemail…</i>

33
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,359
Hello? Xiaoqi.

34
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:31,999
<i>Do you know what time it is?
Better be important.</i>

35
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,080
<i>Please see if my mom's home.</i>

36
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,999
<i>She was there when I got my headphones.</i>

37
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,479
<i>It's hard to explain.</i>

38
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:41,280
<i>Just check if she's there.</i>

39
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:07,040
THE AIR QUALITY IS AT A HAZARDOUS LEVEL.
PLEASE AVOID GOING OUTSIDE.

40
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,920
Yu-jhen.

41
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:37,800
Yu-jhen.

42
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:50,760
I'll go now.

43
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,280
Why do you look so scared?

44
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:07,000
You're not even wearing a mask.
Aren't you afraid to die?

45
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,000
Do you know her?

46
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,760
Who is she?

47
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,999
And him?

48
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:24,599
Wow, where was this taken?

49
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,680
Edited, right?

50
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,640
The air looks so fresh.

51
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:30,000
I wanna take a deep breath.

52
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,600
Is An-an all right?

53
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,040
Early shift tomorrow?

54
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:22,119
Then go get some sleep.

55
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:25,120
If you fall asleep at work,
you'll get fired.

56
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:38,280
Is An-an off early tomorrow?

57
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:45,800
I can pick him up at noon
and bring him to the library,

58
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:48,039
so he can skip after-school care.

59
00:07:48,040 --> 00:07:49,280
YIPING LIBRARY

60
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,119
Mei-ling,

61
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:08,759
your reactions are so slow today,
even more than usual.

62
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,000
What's wrong?

63
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:14,320
No, it's okay.

64
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:17,280
Thanks. I've already made arrangements.

65
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:53,160
YOUR MOM'S IN THE CAR!

66
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:03,120
CALLING
MOM

67
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,999
<i>Your call has been forwarded to voicemail.</i>

68
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:12,600
<i>Leave a message after the beep or hang up.</i>

69
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,479
Did you check online first?

70
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,559
No, I didn't.

71
00:10:21,560 --> 00:10:25,559
Next time you borrow a book,
reserve it online first. It's faster.

72
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,040
Let me find it for you.

73
00:10:27,880 --> 00:10:29,520
It should be…

74
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,680
here.

75
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,279
Yes, thank you.

76
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,360
No problem.

77
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,919
Mei-ling?

78
00:11:59,920 --> 00:12:01,839
Cancel the peptides I ordered.

79
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:04,839
- He says it's too expensive.
- No. I've placed the order.

80
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,880
Just sell it…

81
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:52,799
WELCOME TO YIPING ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

82
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:55,359
THE CURRENT AIR QUALITY
IS UNHEALTHY FOR ALL GROUPS.

83
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,600
PLEASE LIMIT OUTDOOR ACTIVITIES

84
00:13:40,760 --> 00:13:41,920
An-an's mom?

85
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,760
Come on. Let's go.

86
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:58,079
An-an's mom. I thought An-an
was going to after-school care.

87
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,640
Good thing you came.

88
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:04,200
He brought a baseball to school
and someone got hit.

89
00:14:05,120 --> 00:14:10,240
The school doesn't allow it,
especially outside in this haze.

90
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:14,640
So please remind An-an
about this next time, okay?

91
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:29,679
- An-an.
- What's wrong?

92
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:32,079
- An-an.
- What happened?

93
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,440
It's okay. Lie down.

94
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,480
Breathe slowly, An-an. An-an.

95
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:40,080
Breathe slowly. An-an's mom, help me.

96
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:42,080
Don't rush.

97
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:44,880
Don't rush. Take slow breaths.

98
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:46,639
Take slow breaths.

99
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,680
That's it.

100
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:50,559
Take slow breaths.

101
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:52,200
Keep breathing, An-an.

102
00:14:53,160 --> 00:14:55,240
That's it. Take slow breaths.

103
00:14:57,760 --> 00:14:59,600
An-an, do you know where you are?

104
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,680
Take your time.

105
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,520
Mom.

106
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:11,480
Skipping class again?

107
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,800
- Didn't I tell you I'd come?
- Lower your voice.

108
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,040
You forgot already?

109
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,200
Rest somewhere. I've got work to do.

110
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:29,080
You even forgot I bought you coffee?

111
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:38,600
YIPING ELEMENTARY,
HSU LI-AN

112
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:43,320
Mom?

113
00:16:44,160 --> 00:16:45,680
Where's your scooter?

114
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:48,240
You didn't ride here?

115
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,479
I wanted to walk with you today.

116
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:55,320
Aren't we going home? Where are we going?

117
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:58,920
Yes, we will go home. We will.

118
00:17:07,599 --> 00:17:10,318
Mom, you're squeezing too hard.

119
00:17:10,319 --> 00:17:12,000
My hand hurts.

120
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,800
Sorry.

121
00:17:16,839 --> 00:17:18,839
Mom, what's wrong today?

122
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,839
Did Dad upset you?

123
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:25,079
Or did I do something wrong again?

124
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:28,040
No.

125
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:30,480
It's nothing.

126
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,120
You did nothing wrong.

127
00:17:33,680 --> 00:17:36,160
Then why are you sad?

128
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,080
Mom's okay.

129
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,240
You're such a good kid.

130
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,360
Let's go.

131
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:10,119
253, 254, 255, 256,

132
00:18:10,120 --> 00:18:13,159
257, 258, 259,

133
00:18:13,160 --> 00:18:20,120
260, 261, 262, 263, 264, 265…

134
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:24,840
Mom, I don't want to see a doctor.

135
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:29,239
I'm really okay. I don't want to go.

136
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:32,520
Okay, we won't see a doctor then.

137
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,320
Excuse me.

138
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,440
Hi, Auntie.

139
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:26,600
Dr. Sun is on break.

140
00:19:27,680 --> 00:19:30,080
Go to a hospital if you need a doctor.

141
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,600
An-an!

142
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:37,760
It really is you.

143
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:41,240
I thought I was mistaken.

144
00:19:45,280 --> 00:19:48,200
Hi, Uncle. Mom picked me up today.

145
00:19:50,600 --> 00:19:51,920
You didn't ride today?

146
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:54,240
Mom didn't ride today.

147
00:19:55,400 --> 00:19:57,119
Are we walking home?

148
00:19:57,120 --> 00:19:59,879
Walking? It's too far. I'll take you home.

149
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:00,960
Yay!

150
00:20:07,440 --> 00:20:10,079
We can go home ourselves.
Don't worry about it.

151
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,480
It's no trouble. None at all.

152
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:15,280
Wait for me a moment.

153
00:20:31,280 --> 00:20:32,440
<i>Mom.</i>

154
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:35,440
Mom.

155
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,960
Mom!

156
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,640
Mom!

157
00:20:53,640 --> 00:20:54,680
Mom!

158
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,360
PSYCHIATRY CLINIC

159
00:21:08,760 --> 00:21:10,840
- Due on March 11th.
- Thanks.

160
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:48,680
When did you buy me coffee?

161
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:53,680
You really forgot?

162
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:56,240
I even lent you 200 bucks.

163
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,840
You have a twin sister?

164
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,399
Hi, teacher.

165
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:42,600
This is An-an's mom. Is An-an okay?

166
00:22:54,240 --> 00:22:55,919
Let me take you out to eat.

167
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:58,640
My appointments start at 3:00,
so I have time.

168
00:23:04,840 --> 00:23:05,880
Mei-ling?

169
00:23:07,360 --> 00:23:08,759
Mom?

170
00:23:08,760 --> 00:23:11,920
Uncle wants to know
if we're eating together.

171
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:16,320
No, thank you.

172
00:23:17,680 --> 00:23:18,880
I'll take Yoo…

173
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,400
I'll take An-an home.

174
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:27,039
- We're going on vacation.
- Really?

175
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:28,760
Is Dad going with us?

176
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:33,360
When we get home,

177
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:35,999
we'll talk it over with Dad.

178
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:37,320
If he agrees,

179
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:40,000
we'll leave here.

180
00:23:41,200 --> 00:23:43,480
"Leave"? Where are you going?

181
00:23:45,040 --> 00:23:48,119
An-an isn't in any condition
to travel right now.

182
00:23:48,120 --> 00:23:49,439
I can.

183
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:51,159
An-an, can you handle it?

184
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:53,199
What if you have another seizure?

185
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:56,560
We'd be so worried
if Mom and Dad couldn't find a doctor.

186
00:23:58,920 --> 00:24:00,279
We'll look after him.

187
00:24:00,280 --> 00:24:01,600
Thanks for caring.

188
00:24:06,680 --> 00:24:08,880
I checked. She's not in the backyard.

189
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:12,840
I'll check the basement.
I'll call you later.

190
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:17,440
Mom!

191
00:24:27,320 --> 00:24:28,440
Mom!

192
00:24:31,040 --> 00:24:32,400
Are you in there?

193
00:24:40,600 --> 00:24:41,640
Mom?

194
00:24:44,520 --> 00:24:45,760
Are you in there?

195
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:36,080
- Bye, Uncle.
- Okay, head inside.

196
00:25:36,960 --> 00:25:38,120
What's wrong today?

197
00:25:41,360 --> 00:25:42,760
You're acting strange.

198
00:25:46,280 --> 00:25:47,680
When can we meet again?

199
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:52,160
I need to talk to you.

200
00:26:03,160 --> 00:26:04,200
Level five?

201
00:26:04,720 --> 00:26:07,639
Mom, the smog is coming! Get inside!

202
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:08,599
Okay.

203
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:11,000
Go inside. We'll meet another time.

204
00:26:20,360 --> 00:26:22,679
But I forgot to bring the keys.

205
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:23,760
I've got it.

206
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:33,439
Mom, I told Grandma we're going out today.

207
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:35,880
Is Dad coming home? When?

208
00:27:37,440 --> 00:27:38,440
"Grandma"?

209
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:41,760
Mom, look outside.

210
00:27:42,400 --> 00:27:44,280
What happened?

211
00:28:02,840 --> 00:28:05,600
Yoo-shin. come on. Let's go.
Hurry up. Hurry.

212
00:28:10,800 --> 00:28:11,999
An-an, let's go.

213
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,999
- Come on, let's go. Hurry up.
- No!

214
00:28:14,000 --> 00:28:14,959
- No!
- Come on.

215
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:16,239
- I don't want to!
- Come.

216
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:17,679
An-an, sweetheart.

217
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:19,759
- I don't want to!
- Come on.

218
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:21,039
Hurry up!

219
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:22,080
I don't want to!

220
00:28:39,800 --> 00:28:43,320
No…

221
00:28:56,200 --> 00:28:57,560
<i>The door is unlocked.</i>

222
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:12,200
She's back.

223
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:16,079
Mom, where were you?

224
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:18,360
You didn't answer. We were so worried.

225
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:33,880
An-an!

226
00:29:34,680 --> 00:29:36,440
- An-an!
- Mom.

227
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:41,399
Who was supposed to pick you up?

228
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,719
She left.

229
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:44,319
You knew she wasn't me.

230
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:46,920
- You still let her take you!
- I didn't know!

231
00:29:49,920 --> 00:29:51,919
I thought she was you.

232
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,680
She looked just like you

233
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,960
and was wearing your jacket.

234
00:30:02,560 --> 00:30:04,079
<i>I was so close.</i>

235
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:07,280
So close to bringing Yoo-shin back.

236
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,280
So close.

237
00:30:16,080 --> 00:30:17,280
So close.

238
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:24,280
Is she the mom in the mirror?

239
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:26,800
I told you, she's not your mom.

240
00:30:40,480 --> 00:30:43,360
I was afraid of losing you,
that's why I hit you.

241
00:30:58,080 --> 00:30:59,160
Thief!

242
00:31:16,320 --> 00:31:17,760
I'm talking to you.

243
00:32:04,800 --> 00:32:06,240
Don't take my son!

244
00:32:10,080 --> 00:32:11,240
Li Yun.

245
00:32:12,360 --> 00:32:13,440
Li Yun.

246
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:19,280
Li Yun.

247
00:32:22,840 --> 00:32:23,920
Are you all right?

248
00:32:38,280 --> 00:32:40,200
I was in meetings all day.

249
00:32:41,400 --> 00:32:45,720
Yu-jhen was worried sick
and rushed back after two classes.

250
00:32:47,120 --> 00:32:48,280
Why ignore me?

251
00:32:49,280 --> 00:32:52,640
- I'll go see her.
- No need. She's back in Taipei.

252
00:32:53,360 --> 00:32:54,760
She has class tomorrow.

253
00:33:02,560 --> 00:33:04,120
Why didn't you tell me?

254
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:06,720
Dr. Jian called.

255
00:33:07,280 --> 00:33:09,360
She couldn't find you. She was worried.

256
00:33:11,280 --> 00:33:12,640
I lost my phone.

257
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,999
I left it there…

258
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,399
at the library.

259
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,440
I know.

260
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,200
Yu-jhen said

261
00:33:19,920 --> 00:33:21,560
you went to another world.

262
00:33:23,080 --> 00:33:24,120
Yes.

263
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:35,520
You don't believe me.

264
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:39,720
Dr. Jian wants to see you tomorrow.

265
00:33:40,520 --> 00:33:41,600
I'll go with you.

266
00:33:43,800 --> 00:33:46,399
Or we can find another doctor

267
00:33:46,400 --> 00:33:48,520
- in Taipei.
- Look at this jacket.

268
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,719
You've never seen me wear it, right?

269
00:33:51,720 --> 00:33:53,799
I brought it from another world.

270
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:56,999
And this name tag belongs to An-an.

271
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:00,160
See? His name is Xu Li-an.
Everyone calls him An-an.

272
00:34:05,600 --> 00:34:07,079
You were sleepwalking.

273
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:11,079
- Where did you find it?
- Ｎo, I wasn't sleepwalking. This is real.

274
00:34:11,080 --> 00:34:13,039
I held Yoo-shin's hand.

275
00:34:13,040 --> 00:34:15,760
It was warm and soft.

276
00:34:16,520 --> 00:34:19,559
It felt real.

277
00:34:19,560 --> 00:34:21,759
It's true. I went to another world.

278
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:26,360
I opened the door and ended up there.
I don't know why…

279
00:34:30,800 --> 00:34:31,880
What time is it?

280
00:34:32,639 --> 00:34:33,719
Nearly 3:00.

281
00:34:36,639 --> 00:34:40,039
The mirror cracked at 2:00 a.m.

282
00:34:40,040 --> 00:34:42,679
- I came back in the afternoon--
- I haven't slept.

283
00:34:43,400 --> 00:34:44,880
The mirror didn't crack.

284
00:34:47,400 --> 00:34:48,760
I'll go with you tomorrow.

285
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:07,720
Why not sleep in?

286
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:11,000
I got enough sleep.

287
00:35:16,080 --> 00:35:17,519
What happened?

288
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:19,320
Something fell into the drain.

289
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,560
What did you drop?

290
00:35:29,160 --> 00:35:30,200
My ring.

291
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:36,239
- I'll take care of the drain later--
- Can you fix it?

292
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:37,360
Don't bother.

293
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,400
It's filthy in there.

294
00:35:40,200 --> 00:35:41,840
I'll call someone later.

295
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,999
Aren't you working today?

296
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:47,120
I'll stay with you.

297
00:35:48,120 --> 00:35:49,240
I took a week off.

298
00:35:50,160 --> 00:35:51,960
I'll go with you to Dr. Jian.

299
00:35:58,120 --> 00:36:02,360
<i>Did you fall asleep before you went there?</i>

300
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:04,960
I wasn't dreaming.

301
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:08,880
I believe you.

302
00:36:10,320 --> 00:36:14,079
Can you tell me what happened?

303
00:36:14,080 --> 00:36:16,279
What was that other world like?

304
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:18,800
Did you see anything you'll never forget?

305
00:36:30,120 --> 00:36:31,160
I saw you.

306
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,880
You saw me?

307
00:36:34,520 --> 00:36:36,080
You're a nurse

308
00:36:37,160 --> 00:36:38,320
at a clinic.

309
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:41,480
But you… seemed so distant.

310
00:36:42,840 --> 00:36:46,839
The doctor looked
just like Jian-cheng's friend.

311
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:48,280
<i>He's a real estate agent here.</i>

312
00:36:50,360 --> 00:36:51,560
It's true.

313
00:36:53,440 --> 00:36:56,520
That doctor and Mei-ling seemed close,

314
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:59,999
like they had something going on.

315
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:01,360
If it wasn't a dream,

316
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:03,919
then a hallucination?

317
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:06,080
Let's let her finish, okay?

318
00:37:18,360 --> 00:37:19,400
Dr. Jian,

319
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:23,480
thanks for your patience. I'm really okay.

320
00:37:24,720 --> 00:37:25,800
I'm really fine.

321
00:37:27,200 --> 00:37:28,320
I haven't felt

322
00:37:29,680 --> 00:37:31,680
this clear-headed in three years.

323
00:37:34,400 --> 00:37:36,800
Sorry to take up your time. Thank you.

324
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:56,520
One of her pills is Stilnox.

325
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,759
It causes sleepwalking.

326
00:37:58,760 --> 00:38:02,840
Could that be what happened last night?

327
00:38:04,920 --> 00:38:07,920
She's taken it before and slept well.

328
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:11,319
Sleepwalkers don't know
what they're doing.

329
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:14,840
She remembers everything clearly,
so not sleepwalking.

330
00:38:17,200 --> 00:38:19,280
You doubt my professional opinion?

331
00:38:20,520 --> 00:38:21,960
That's not what I meant.

332
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:24,280
I'm just worried.

333
00:38:26,640 --> 00:38:28,480
How can I help her?

334
00:38:35,080 --> 00:38:38,000
I think you're the key

335
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,960
to her recovery.

336
00:38:44,120 --> 00:38:48,760
I'll prescribe medication,
but it takes at least seven days to work.

337
00:38:49,680 --> 00:38:51,280
Can you talk to her?

338
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,439
I'll arrange counseling.

339
00:38:55,440 --> 00:38:56,880
Will you come with her?

340
00:39:19,160 --> 00:39:21,200
I'll take you to get a new phone later.

341
00:39:24,640 --> 00:39:26,920
There's an old one at home I can use.

342
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:30,520
Then let's go home.

343
00:39:32,880 --> 00:39:35,800
- I need to pack my things.
- I'll go with you.

344
00:39:38,080 --> 00:39:40,600
Next time, I'll definitely bring Yoo-shin…

345
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:44,480
I'll bring An-an back

346
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:46,800
and prove it to you.

347
00:39:52,360 --> 00:39:56,040
If you're telling the truth,
An-an is someone else's child.

348
00:39:57,280 --> 00:40:00,279
Is it right to take him away?

349
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:02,480
That's heaven's gift for my loss.

350
00:40:10,520 --> 00:40:11,600
Li Yun!

351
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:23,679
THE APPOINTMENT IS AT 2 PM
THE DAY AFTER TOMORROW.

352
00:40:23,680 --> 00:40:27,080
JUST BE PATIENT AND LET HER SPEAK.

353
00:40:30,680 --> 00:40:34,560
OKAY.

354
00:40:39,480 --> 00:40:40,959
Sorry, bro.

355
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,000
Waiting long?

356
00:40:42,640 --> 00:40:45,239
That last customer
asked so many questions.

357
00:40:45,240 --> 00:40:46,879
I called you last minute.

358
00:40:46,880 --> 00:40:48,320
When can we sign?

359
00:40:51,120 --> 00:40:53,719
I've been home lately.

360
00:40:53,720 --> 00:40:55,680
Let's find a time to go over it.

361
00:41:01,480 --> 00:41:04,520
Have you thought it through, bro?

362
00:41:07,560 --> 00:41:09,079
Why do you ask?

363
00:41:09,080 --> 00:41:11,080
I said your price was fine.

364
00:41:12,520 --> 00:41:13,839
I know.

365
00:41:13,840 --> 00:41:15,600
But didn't you say yesterday

366
00:41:16,240 --> 00:41:17,720
you weren't selling?

367
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,080
No, I didn't.

368
00:41:32,720 --> 00:41:34,720
Bro, don't joke.

369
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:40,559
We were here yesterday.

370
00:41:40,560 --> 00:41:44,000
You held my hand
and said you weren't selling.

371
00:41:46,160 --> 00:41:47,320
Don't you remember?

372
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:53,080
I really didn't.

373
00:42:00,440 --> 00:42:01,720
Are you free tonight?

374
00:42:02,720 --> 00:42:04,160
Yes.

375
00:42:05,360 --> 00:42:06,480
Let's meet tonight.

376
00:42:07,720 --> 00:42:08,759
Want a drink?

377
00:42:08,760 --> 00:42:10,600
I'm good. I'll just have water.

378
00:42:39,720 --> 00:42:40,960
<i>The door is unlocked.</i>
